  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Fa Jin — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You have mastered reverse cursed technique and learned the reversal of your technique. Once per turn on a hit with an unarmed strike, you can spend 2 ce to give the target 3 negative Jin charges. When that creature makes an attack or uses a technique that deals damage, you can spend any number of their negative Jin charges to deal 1d6 less damage. If this reduces an attack or effect’s damage to 0, it is nullified and has no effect.</p>",
